## Required acceptance contract

Todo 21 requires the real installed Windows tray client and canonical Scheduled Task
`\wifimic\wifimic-client`, plus the active Linux service. The ordered run must observe:
streaming active -> Exit clicked -> Linux `Idle` within 2 seconds -> Windows process exited
-> task still `Ready` -> next logon -> auto-start -> streaming resumed within 10 seconds.
The failure-path run must observe mid-session Restart keeping the process/task alive and
producing a strictly greater session ID within 10 seconds.

